message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RAINBOHz"
abstract: >-
  A research system for macro-scale additive synthesis: very large numbers
  of partials, controlled over the timescale of a complete work described by
  a score in HzL, a declarative domain-specific language.
authors:
  - given-names: Alan
    family-names: Broady
    affiliation: "The Open University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/broadya/RAINBOHz"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - additive synthesis
  - audio rendering
  - domain-specific language
  - sound design
  - music programming systems
  - music composition
